      "originalText": " Migration, first release\n - connect on: relay and remote turn on, unless the user chose\n - The signed-in app registers B (PLX-1146)\n - A tailnet: connection drops once the same key answers as\n   account:, matched by the JWK thumbprint of the reached cert",
